{"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/encode\/share()"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Encode\/share()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"share"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncBroadcastSequence"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"code":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that multicasts elements to multiple consumers concurrently.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This operator is an alias for ","type":"text"},{"code":"broadcast()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", providing identical behavior.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"It enables multicasting of values from the upstream sequence to multiple"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"concurrent consumers without duplicating upstream work. A consumer receives"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the elements the shared sequence reads from the upstream after the consumer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"creates its iterator; elements already read and handed out are not replayed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Example","anchor":"Example","type":"heading","level":2},{"code":["\/\/ Create an AsyncStream that emits 3 random values between 1 and 5","let upstream = AsyncStream<Int> { continuation in","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.finish()","}","","let sharedSequence = upstream.share()","","async let firstConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"First consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","async let secondConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"Second consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","\/\/ A consumer that subscribes after the shared sequence has handed out values misses them.","await firstConsumer.value","await secondConsumer.value"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE5shareAA22AsyncBroadcastSequenceVyxGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO6EncodeV","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"relatedModules":["_Concurrency"],"name":"Afluent"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/SequenceOperators\/ShareSequence.swift#L113","fileName":"ShareSequence.swift"},"title":"share()","extendedModule":"_Concurrency","fragments":[{"kind":